Production on the film first began in 2012 with Tom Cruise attached to star.

15
01:07:49,565 --> 01:07:55,565
The film then fell into development hell until
Netflix acquired the distribution rights.

16
01:12:20,869 --> 01:12:26,869
Filming commenced in November 2020 and wrapped in March 2021.

17
01:16:52,173 --> 01:16:58,173
Rob Simonsen composed the score.

18
01:21:23,478 --> 01:21:29,478
The Adam Project began a limited "one night only" theatrical release on
March 9, 2022, followed by its streaming release on March 11.

19
01:25:54,782 --> 01:26:00,782
The film received mixed reviews from critics, who praised the performances, action sequences, visual
effects, and its inspiration from 1980s movies, but criticized its writing and storyline.

20
